    <h1>PRD =E2=80=94 Instructions &amp; Scaffold</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h2 local-id=3D"e9bd485e1daf" id=3D"PRD=E2=80=94Instructions&amp;Sc=
affold-PHASE1=E2=80=94PLAN">PHASE 1 =E2=80=94 PLAN</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"abf06c8a7258" id=3D"PRD=E2=80=94Instructions&amp;Scaffold-I=
nputChecklist">Input Checklist</h3>
<p local-id=3D"9f18bc7c8005">Before planning, confirm you have each input. =
Report the status of every item out loud before proceeding.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"24=
ed19c1a8f7" class=3D"confluenceTable">
