<p local-id=3D"41e9afbe022c">User journey =E2=80=94 screens and sequence</p=
></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"91f9ea1c078b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c1e17ff8e0a4">ok / partial / missing</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7fbe7ad7d5c0">
