<td data-local-id=3D"f765a0b7ef66" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"94c4f7d39d51">Dependencies</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a2d163ac379c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"84b16d034c75">ok / partial / missing</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"852e78b388b9">
<td data-local-id=3D"01598d9700b1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6ddf366ace54">7</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7b8da6e8fdfd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"20ae83e157dd">Wireframes / prototype</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c0df87950aec" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dd90af41ea0d">ok / missing</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d6c4b4aeeb7f">
<td data-local-id=3D"e347effdd659" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b0c1d2ccd12d">8</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"941f6cc17399" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6c98cc343b2d">Related pages and source document links</p></t=
d>
<td data-local-id=3D"68af88d25828" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8ffcbcd7e772">ok / missing</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<ul local-id=3D"b1de75aaabc5">
<li local-id=3D"6e3d42c06ade">
<p local-id=3D"495270c8fe6a">missing =E2=80=94 ask the user before planning=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fb4889be1374">
<p local-id=3D"ac8a3ac03528">partial =E2=80=94 proceed and flag the gap in =
the Questions section</p></li>
</ul>
<blockquote local-id=3D"6dacbd6bef8f">
<p local-id=3D"f58e46ba95e9"><strong>Note:</strong> This scaffold assumes y=
our project uses an EpicCode naming convention (e.g. INV-F01). Adjust the F=
eature ID format, Document Reference format, and branch/story naming to mat=
ch your project's conventions if different.</p>
</blockquote>
<h3 local-id=3D"49c7d860f344" id=3D"PRD=E2=80=94Instructions&amp;Scaffold-P=
lanFormat">Plan Format</h3>
<p local-id=3D"90fa34000a3d">You must use exactly this format and no other.=
 Produce this plan and stop. Wait for PM approval before generating.</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">PRD PLA=
N =E2=80=94 [Epic Name] ([EpicCode])

Initiative: [from source material or ask user if not present]

WHAT I UNDERSTOOD
[2-3 sentences =E2=80=94 what this epic delivers and what problem it solves=
]

FEATURES I WILL INCLUDE
[EpicCode]-F01  [Feature Name]  [Priority]
[EpicCode]-F02  [Feature Name]  [Priority]

OUT OF SCOPE
[One line each]

USER JOURNEY STEPS
1. [Screen] =E2=80=94 [action]
2. [Screen] =E2=80=94 [action]

QUESTIONS BEFORE I PROCEED
[Genuine blockers only. If none: "None =E2=80=94 ready to proceed."]

WAITING FOR APPROVAL =E2=80=94 reply APPROVED to continue, or tell me what =
to change.</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"1ba1bf499c99">Do not generate the PRD until the user replies=
 with APPROVED or an equivalent clear confirmation. If the user requests ch=
anges, revise the plan and wait again.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"b7e3b7988bd8">
<h2 local-id=3D"a87dc4596c77" id=3D"PRD=E2=80=94Instructions&amp;Scaffold-P=
HASE2=E2=80=94EXECUTE">PHASE 2 =E2=80=94 EXECUTE</h2>
<p local-id=3D"9ff45e2fe709">Only begin this phase after receiving approval=
 in Phase 1.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"569b77358ae9" id=3D"PRD=E2=80=94Instructions&amp;Scaffold-W=
ritingRules">Writing Rules</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"71fe79454181">
<li local-id=3D"cc4dd5b08cef">
<p local-id=3D"8f4dfc8dca56">Active voice =E2=80=94 "The system sends" not =
"A notification is sent"</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0b95888401fa">
<p local-id=3D"9b48abbb04e6">Precise quantities =E2=80=94 "within 3 seconds=
" not "quickly"</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6897027da914">
<p local-id=3D"7a4c715a3ba2">Must / shall / will =E2=80=94 never should / m=
ight / could</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"179e1708edfd">
<p local-id=3D"3736bcdb6efd">One requirement per line</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d8f97788b8e5">
<p local-id=3D"46e28ddcf6a4">Define every acronym on first use</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"05fa629753e4">
<p local-id=3D"ea2e2b7ea1c1">Define the what, not the how =E2=80=94 PRD is =
requirements, not implementation</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4df5ab93308d">
<p local-id=3D"e687de587072">AC Granularity: Each AC must define the specif=
ic system behaviour for both the success and failure path =E2=80=94 for exa=
mple "System must [action] when [condition], and must [failure behaviour] w=
hen [failure condition]". For data ingestion features, ACs must explicitly =
state the behaviour for hard rejects, warnings, partial acceptance, and err=
or log format</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"157c75583cc2" id=3D"PRD=E2=80=94Instructions&amp;Scaffold-C=
ontentRules">Content Rules</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"5061ee4a36bc">
<li local-id=3D"3cf584be07f9">
<p local-id=3D"b8aec1f088ce">Summarise from source documents =E2=80=94 do n=
ot copy-paste</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d2c052284e66">
<p local-id=3D"3c4f6266a1de">Flag as TBC if something is not in the inputs =
=E2=80=94 do not invent</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"80048cccee2b">
<p local-id=3D"7757e1d67e10">Screen names must come from source documents o=
nly</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ad8ea27098c9">
<p local-id=3D"f996c589e51c">NFRs written from the user's perspective =E2=
=80=94 what the user experiences</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"dedf4ea1e9ab">
<p local-id=3D"bf16b6258a8e">Apply project NFR defaults from your Project R=
ules document unless the epic specifies otherwise</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"30fdc2e3b0a2">
<p local-id=3D"701831918d75">File format acceptance (CSV, XLSX) is a functi=
onal requirement =E2=80=94 not an NFR</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"06a83029ae00">
<p local-id=3D"ac2633540f29">Every AC must be testable =E2=80=94 "works cor=
rectly" is not AC</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9eb566d3b55a">
<p local-id=3D"d23e13e13bbd">Always cover: happy path, validation failure, =
empty state</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"14641eb3494c">
<p local-id=3D"4bc0c7c704fe">Group related validation failures on the same =
screen into one story with multiple ACs =E2=80=94 not one story per failure=
 condition</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7fff87aaeb7c">
<p local-id=3D"c7921698cf83">Always consider edge cases: first use, error s=
tate, no data, max data, invalid input</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e8d12af005a0">
<p local-id=3D"c289a189ea74">If no wireframes are provided, write Wireframe=
 Instructions based on the user journey and flag each screen as TBC</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"2cce4baf8f18">
<p local-id=3D"3de27576aad9">Section 4 must always include a Mermaid flowch=
art diagram =E2=80=94 this is mandatory, not optional</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"69f81ba24f7a">
<p local-id=3D"b3ea255cc243">No Lossy Summarisation: Every validation rule,=
 formula, and logic step mentioned in the source material (e.g. hard reject=
, warn, partial acceptance, upsert, replace-in-range) must be explicitly co=
nverted into its own Acceptance Criterion. Do not generalise multiple rules=
 into one AC</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3ffb9b1dda1a">
<p local-id=3D"fd47eaf6236c">Persona Integrity: Section 2 must include ever=
y persona mentioned in the source context pages. Do not consolidate or omit=
 personas</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7bc29be524e7">
<p local-id=3D"3ecb57f67275">Reference Completeness: Section 12 must includ=
e all links found in the Related Pages or Reference sections of the source =
documents</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"ef00be829705" id=3D"PRD=E2=80=94Instructions&amp;Scaffold-O=
utput">Output</h3>
<p local-id=3D"f8c142767a5b">After generating the full PRD content, output =
it in full in the chat exactly as it will appear in Confluence. Do not summ=
arise. Do not truncate. The user must be able to read and review the comple=
te PRD before verification begins.</p>
<p local-id=3D"0353d44a6687">Then immediately proceed to Phase 3 =E2=80=94 =
Verify. Do not wait for user input before running Verify.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"bed4fe3416dc" id=3D"PRD=E2=80=94Instructions&amp;Scaffold-S=
caffold">Scaffold</h3>
<hr local-id=3D"0ede98f9af6b">
<h2 local-id=3D"5b96448e3b3f" id=3D"PRD=E2=80=94Instructions&amp;Scaffold-O=
verview">Overview</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"27=
c6f31dae07" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9806378a2166">
<th data-local-id=3D"0af44d7c31c3" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"31c17930ac5c">Attribute</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"c52b10d106b7" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"01cfe5947d50">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2f61b9600cfe">
<td data-local-id=3D"c12eb1744a08" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2a78ff6667f0">Initiative</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b06a32802ffa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f21e9627f2fd">[from source material or ask user if not prese=
nt]</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ca0872bc3aaf">
<td data-local-id=3D"f4f644af8659" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5ef5f3444bf9">Epic</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b19600e239d5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"51e9a38d8ee0">[Epic Name]</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"98ab2142b132">
<td data-local-id=3D"a69febf45e6c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9723e222a6ab">Epic Code</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e1bbc788a845" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"871a821e7ac2">[EpicCode]</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"951858612a03">
<td data-local-id=3D"ab8d93f2ff8e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"004dad90062d">Document Reference</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9949e7ee52ef" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f266e55ceaf6">PRD-[EpicCode]-v1.0</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"30ddbdd2a53d">
<td data-local-id=3D"d4db282b212d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"39e5fff23fb6">Document Owner</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"eeba01289a65" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e9fc6480ce9b">[Name]</p></td>
</tr>
